    "the_actionable_recommendation": "The single highest-value follow-on is not more source acquisition. It is adjudicating the twenty or so DCS lemma strings listed above against the Rigvedic root map, the way ACTION_PREDICATE_ROOT_MAPPING_V3.md adjudicated the Rigvedic ones. vid, i, pa and dvis alone account for 769 Atharvavedic and 115 Yajurvedic finite verbs that currently abstain. That is a bounded, one-time philological task over a named list, not an open-ended one."
